    title: "Champion Baseball",
    description: Some("Central League all-stars face Pacific League all-stars over nine innings, in close-up at the plate: line the batter up with the pitch, swing, or tap out a bunt. Pitching is the mirror image — shift on the mound, throw, then bend the ball left or right in flight — while runners steal, advance and scramble back on command."),
